---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title=Adam Ochwat description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🤓 Hello!</h1>
			<p>
				I am a social researcher based in Warsaw, Poland. My interests lay at the intersection of historical sociology, economic history and higher education studies. I am currently in my final year of MA in sociology at the University of Warsaw.
			</p>
			<p>
				This template comes with a few integrations already configured in your
				<code>astro.config.mjs</code> file. You can customize your setup with
				<a href="https://astro.build/integrations">Astro Integrations</a> to add tools like Tailwind,
				React, or Vue to your project.
			</p>
			<p>Here are my research activities at a glance:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Student researcher at the <a href="https://sc.amu.edu.pl">Scholarly Communication Research Group</a> at Adam Mickiewicz University: 2024–</code></li>
				<ul>
					<li>Co-authored article on student clubs and primitive accumulation for the <a href="https://www.praktykateoretyczna.pl/call-for-papers/terapia-szokowa-a-narodziny-peryferyjnego-kapitalizmu-akademickiego-w-polsce-1990-1999/">December 2026 Praktyka Teoretyczna issue</a></li>
					<li>Contributed chapters to the upcoming <a href="https://sc.amu.edu.pl/projects/the-consequences-of-the-shock-therapy-for-science-and-higher-education/">report</a> on the consequences of shock therapy of the 1990s for higher education in Poland</li>
					<li>Presented preliminary research results at Historical Materialism Istanbul in April 2026</li>
					<li></li>
				</ul>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Have fun! If you get stuck, remember to <a href="https://docs.astro.build/"
					>read the docs
				</a> or <a href="https://astro.build/chat">join us on Discord</a> to ask questions.
			</p>
			<p>
				Looking for a blog template with a bit more personality? Check out <a
					href="https://github.com/Charca/astro-blog-template"
					>astro-blog-template
				</a> by <a href="https://twitter.com/Charca">Maxi Ferreira</a>.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
